212
00:08:21,039 --> 00:08:25,759
nuclear magnetic resonance, but renamed

213
00:08:23,280 --> 00:08:27,440
for public perception.

214
00:08:25,759 --> 00:08:29,680
Now let's take a group of hydrogen

215
00:08:27,440 --> 00:08:31,759
atoms. The body contains a large amount

216
00:08:29,680 --> 00:08:33,839
of hydrogen because we are mostly water

217
00:08:31,759 --> 00:08:36,080
