219
00:08:36,080 --> 00:08:40,880
protons are randomly oriented. But when

220
00:08:38,560 --> 00:08:42,959
we apply an external magnetic field, the

221
00:08:40,880 --> 00:08:46,080
protons tend to align with the field

222
00:08:42,959 --> 00:08:48,320
precessing around its axis.

223
00:08:46,080 --> 00:08:50,320
When we emit radiation sideways, as

224
00:08:48,320 --> 00:08:52,080
discussed before, the protons flatten

225
00:08:50,320 --> 00:08:54,720
out. And when the radiation is turned

226
00:08:52,080 --> 00:08:57,120
