237
00:09:14,959 --> 00:09:18,880
in strength which aligns the magnetic

238
00:09:16,800 --> 00:09:22,000
field along the tube's axis so that all

239
00:09:18,880 --> 00:09:23,920
the protons line up and precess.

240
00:09:22,000 --> 00:09:25,920
