254
00:09:52,959 --> 00:09:57,600
frequency, only protons at that slice

255
00:09:55,120 --> 00:10:00,640
will resonate and emit radiation. This

256
00:09:57,600 --> 00:10:03,440
gives spatial localization.

257
00:10:00,640 --> 00:10:05,839
Engineers extended this idea by using

258
00:10:03,440 --> 00:10:07,839
