266
00:10:22,480 --> 00:10:29,720
signal. That's why MRI works so well for

267
00:10:25,040 --> 00:10:29,720
imaging soft tissues in the human body.

268
00:10:31,120 --> 00:10:35,600
So that gives us a general idea of how

269
00:10:33,040 --> 00:10:38,079
