270
00:10:35,600 --> 00:10:40,000
contain a lot of water like soft tissues

271
00:10:38,079 --> 00:10:42,399
produce strong signals which show up

272
00:10:40,000 --> 00:10:44,399
bright in the image.

273
00:10:42,399 --> 00:10:46,240
Areas with little water like bone

274
00:10:44,399 --> 00:10:48,399
