298
00:11:38,640 --> 00:11:42,200
will look at next.

299
00:11:43,680 --> 00:11:47,839
Now let's look at the crossroduct. When

300
00:11:45,920 --> 00:11:49,920
you take two vectors, say vector A and

301
00:11:47,839 --> 00:11:51,760
vector B, their cross productduct is not

302
00:11:49,920 --> 00:11:54,079
