00:11:58,880 --> 00:12:03,120
sign of the angle between them. The

307
00:12:01,040 --> 00:12:05,200
direction of the result is perpendicular

308
00:12:03,120 --> 00:12:08,079
to the plane formed by A and B

309
00:12:05,200 --> 00:12:09,760
determined by the right- hand rule.

310
00:12:08,079 --> 00:12:11,200
So, while the dotproduct gives us a

311
00:12:09,760 --> 00:12:13,120
projection, the cross productduct gives

312
00:12:11,200 --> 00:12:15,360
