315
00:12:17,120 --> 00:12:22,560
trick. It has deep physical meaning.

316
00:12:20,240 --> 00:12:24,399
In MRI physics, crossroducts appear

317
00:12:22,560 --> 00:12:26,880
naturally when we describe torqus,

318
00:12:24,399 --> 00:12:28,720
angular momentum, and precession, making

