00:13:48,959 --> 00:13:51,760
This principle is central in

355
00:13:50,560 --> 00:13:53,839
understanding procession and

356
00:13:51,760 --> 00:13:57,800
magnetization which we will soon connect

357
00:13:53,839 --> 00:13:57,800
back to MRI physics.

358
00:13:59,360 --> 00:14:03,279
Let's quickly review some high school

