00:42:53,520 --> 00:42:57,760
with RF perturbation, then the block

1097
00:42:55,599 --> 00:43:00,319
equations that describe the dynamics and

1098
00:42:57,760 --> 00:43:02,400
finally how we detect the free induction

1099
00:43:00,319 --> 00:43:04,000
decay signal.

1100
00:43:02,400 --> 00:43:06,000
So, let's pay attention to the next

1101
00:43:04,000 --> 00:43:09,000
slide. This is where MRI really comes

1102
00:43:06,000 --> 00:43:09,000
alive.

1103
00:43:10,400 --> 00:43:14,560
So here's the key motivation for MR

1104
